    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d6296220c7bb48728a2a0b207555595e",
      "statement": "aws-get is a single generic read action covering many AWS resource types declared in one awsResources registry table, each entry specifying its required AWS service client, how it treats a target id (optional/required/unsupported), and which extra params it accepts; a param the resource does not accept is rejected rather than silently ignored.",
